# VYRO — OTT Streaming Platform

**Stories that stay with you.**

VYRO is a cinematic OTT streaming platform UI/UX design project created in Figma. It focuses on helping users discover movies and series, explore content, manage a personal watchlist, and navigate a viewing experience through a dark, modern interface.

## Project Overview

VYRO uses a cinematic black-and-red visual identity, poster-led layouts, and reusable UI components to create a consistent entertainment browsing experience.

## Key Features

- Featured content and trending titles
- Genre-based browsing
- Search interface
- Movie detail screens
- Personal watchlist
- Continue Watching section
- Video player interface with subtitle controls
- Profile management screens
- Subscription plan screens
- Desktop-oriented layouts and responsive design exploration

